OL,3,GNEWSAHuge industrial estate fire shuts
OL,4,ATube line
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large fire has broken out on an
OL,7,Findustrial estate in north-west London,
OL,8,Fcausing the entire Metropolitan Tube
OL,9,Fline to be suspended.
OL,11,FThe London Fire Brigade (LFB) said 125
OL,12,Ffirefighters were tackling the blaze at
OL,13,FHannah Close in Neasden.
OL,15,FThe brigade was alerted just after
OL,16,F11:30 BST and has deployed 20 fire
OL,17,Fengines to the scene. Residents have
OL,18,Fbeen warned to keep their windows and
OL,19,Fdoors shut because of the large amount
OL,20,Fof smoke.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
