OL,3,GNEWSAHuge industrial estate fire shuts
OL,4,ATube line
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport for London has said the
OL,7,Fentire Metropolitan line has been
OL,8,Fsuspended as a result, while the
OL,9,FJubilee line has been part shut between
OL,10,FWillesden Green and Wembley Park.
